          "high": "Demanding work suitable for a top-tier model or high reasoning effort. Requires substantial search or interacting constraints, subtle causal inference, coupled optimization, distributed-systems impossibility, multi-region design, failure analysis, or a long state trace with interacting rules."
        }
      }
    },
